Description Commensurate twisted-bilayer graphene density of states
Prefix generate

TypeOfSystem TwistedBilayerBasedOnMoireCell
TypeOfBL Koshino

MoireCellParameters 3 2 2 3
SuperCell 1
twoLayers .true.
twoLayersZ1 18.33
twoLayersZ2 21.67
InterlayerDistance 3.34
CellHeight 40.0

Kubo.Calc .false.
Diag.Calc .true.
Calculate.DOS .true.
Calculate.Bands .false.

KGrid 8 8 1
NumberofEnergyPoints 301
Epsilon 0.08
DOS.Emin 0-4.0
DOS.Emax 4.0

Neigh.fastNNnotsquare .true.
Neigh.LayerNeighbors 100
Neigh.LayerDistFactor 6.2
TB.NeighLevels 3

# Intralayer model of the reference data: nearest-neighbor hopping only.
# The neighbor search stops at the third shell and the second- and
# third-neighbor F2G2 terms are switched off. Remove these three lines (and
# raise TB.NeighLevels to 5) for the full F2G2 intralayer model, which gives
# different bands and therefore needs its own reference data.
Neigh.CutAtNN3 .true.
SingleLayert2KSL 0.0
SingleLayert3K 0.0

WriteDataFiles .false.
WritePos .false.
